{"id":"n74554-1-8","stage":5,"title":"전직 · 前职","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74554-1-8-1","ko":"예전에는 무슨 일을 하셨어요?","zh":"您以前是做什么工作的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"예전에는","meaning":"很久以前","explanation":"예전：很久以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"예전","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70090","senseId":"1","lemma":"예전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예전에는","audio":"/audio/dd88426ee57094c69780.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"하셨어요?","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하셨어요","audio":"/audio/fff45c00c3c14eba31fc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"75497dc0562cdf68","term":"예전","zh":"很久以前","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3","entryId":"70090","definition":"过去很久的往日。","pronunciation":["예ː전"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe3c4cf4d25cf5b8ce94.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74554-1-8-2","ko":"전직 교사였는데요 아이 낳고 기르느라 일을 좀 오래 쉬었어요.","zh":"我以前是教师，但因为要生孩子并抚养孩子，所以有很长一段时间没工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"전직","meaning":"前职","explanation":"전직：前职。","readings":[{"term":"전직","audio":"/audio/eba4d3a26ef2e1de664a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74554","senseId":"1","lemma":"전직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전직","audio":"/audio/eba4d3a26ef2e1de664a.mp3"}},{"text":"교사였는데요","meaning":"教师","explanation":"교사：教师；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"교사","audio":"/audio/df8671acdd670935b501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24037","senseId":"1","lemma":"교사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교사였는데요","audio":"/audio/5caaac3a227717d7c85e.mp3"}},{"text":"아이","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}},{"text":"낳고","meaning":"生","explanation":"낳다：生；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"낳다","audio":"/audio/2f8905ecc8e062b159a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64391","senseId":"1","lemma":"낳다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낳고","audio":"/audio/e323b932ce5cee91cfe2.mp3"}},{"text":"기르느라","meaning":"养，养育，抚育","explanation":"기르다：养，养育，抚育；느라：说明因忙于前一动作而出现后续情况，常接不利结果。","readings":[{"term":"기르다","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62242","senseId":"2","lemma":"기르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기르느라","audio":"/audio/d